 realt\u00e0 virtuale, un'avvincente narrativa che tratta il tema del caporalato. Avrai a disposizione un mazzo di carte per sconfiggere la mafia, ogni carta porter\u00e0 conseguenza positive o negative in tutta la citt\u00e0. Fai la tua scelta e gioca la tua carta!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Carta_Nostra_Logo_1440_Transparent.png", "id": "7043425425741004", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974482_7043425432407670_5671989590901130667_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=H4rrEHgFa9kQ7kNvwGhv3n6&_nc_oc=Adp_tToEsBhaCE72MW_WlsQvF5ide8mPO827al6X4oLJHOSm2hfV2YDFjbzdKigbnEk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQbf0lbBr4_JO1SvlPTt5SQ8giXoGMALkqGJygS-IQXdw&oe=6B0B0E90"}, {"file_name": "CartaNostra_Logo02.png", "id": "2827330754076823", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003251_2827330757410156_6515219377821251284_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SR65cL5MPnYQ7kNvwFVH8DA&_nc_oc=AdpZVZ3XyttVBH2_-g1BKN-SrOikAJVuim99ZfFNPVmGi8SS0F2PTRv2dbm9DsjEzwk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQR1VcURPs1XD8unVN9to68sdMWr8F7X6jIhPAqOSS7HYQ&oe=6B0B1D84"}, {"file_name": "Carta_Nostra_Square_1440-1440.png", "id": "1149684542675806", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974692_1149684546009139_7602248288164393664_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Lwz6ybQi_PAQ7kNvwGqrByi&_nc_oc=AdqH8ox6_x00bn2BlN68gSs1bUv1U_sJcdFoYcMi8EPKZ124T5duQi9Rb9em2CLKv_U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTeZ5ddhouMERqp4oTxR43xi9WUeXTLxpH6uWWjwL8jpQ&oe=6B0B3830"}, {"file_name": "PDPART02.png", "id": "1140322596965596", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/390315